    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d280-a1">

                <pb facs="0670" n="574" sameAs="frus:frus1879/pg574"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 1 in No.
                    183.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1879-07-01"><hi rendition="#small-caps">July</hi> 1,
                        1879</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">My Dear Colleagues</hi>: I pray you to come into the
                    city immediately in order that we may go to the palace to endeavor, in the name
                    of humanity, to bring to an end the terrible outpouring of blood which deluges
                    the city at this moment.</p>
                <p>Make haste to come; it is already almost too late.</p>
                <p>Your friend and colleague,</p>
                <closer><signed>H. BYRON.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Messrs. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Langston</hi>, Dr. <hi
                            rendition="#small-caps">Graser, Fierro y Cruz, and Huttinot.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
